abstract: >
  Exploratory data analytics project focused on the use of notebooks
  for iterative analysis, inspection, and documentation.
  The project emphasizes working with tabular data,
  combining code, results, and narrative text,
  and applying reproducible analytics practices
  within a version-controlled project workflow.

